                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "New York\u2019s Medicaid program is grossly mismanaged and rampant with waste, fraud, and abuse. I\u00a0am dedicated to ensuring that taxpayer-funded resources effectively support our nation's most vulnerable populations.\u00a0\n\nRecent media reports indicate that state Medicaid programs are failing to verify enrollee eligibility. This is not acceptable.\n\nToday, I requested Medicaid contractors conduct a thorough review to ensure eligibility verification to help those in need.\n\nMore here: https://t.co/ki13lyXiJL",
